    "sub_name": "產業經營實務",
    "sub_ename": "INDUSTRY BUSINESS PRACTICES",
    "describe_ch": "課程規劃以實務為主，以因應未來學生進入業界需求。邀請不同公司主管擔任實務個案輔助，提供真實個案讓學生體驗能習得經營、管理及行銷之相關實務知識與經驗，貫徹學以致用教學目標。",
    "describe_eh": "To practice-based curriculum planning, to meet future needs of students into the industry. Executives from different cases as a practical aid to provide for students to experience real life cases to learn a business, management and marketing-related practical knowledge and experience, apply their knowledge of teaching and implementing goals.",
